OL,3,ABig, noisy and coming to a town near
OL,4,Ayou - why the data centre backlash is
OL,5,Agrowing
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey are at the heart of the AI boom,
OL,8,Fhousing the advanced computer chips and
OL,9,Fservers needed to run services like
OL,10,FChatGPT and Claude.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
