OL,3,AStar Trek actor Walter Koenig, who
OL,4,Aplayed Pavel Chekov, dies aged 90
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis Star Trek co-star George Takei led
OL,7,Fthe tributes on social media on Monday,
OL,8,Fwriting: "Walter was more than Chekov.
OL,9,FHe was a writer, a teacher, a
OL,10,Fthoughtful man, and a loyal friend."
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
