OL,3,AChris Brown given suspended eight-month
OL,4,Aprison sentence over nightclub attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS singer Chris Brown has avoided jail
OL,7,Fafter striking a man twice in the head
OL,8,Fwith a glass tequila bottle in a London
OL,9,Fnightclub.
OL,11,FThe R&B star was given an eight-month
OL,12,Fprison sentence, suspended for 12
OL,13,Fmonths, over the attack at private
OL,14,Fmembers' club Tape in Mayfair, in the
OL,15,Fearly hours of 19 February 2023.
OL,17,FBrown's vocal coach, rapper Omololu
OL,18,FAkinlolu, who joined the attack, was
OL,19,Fsentenced to four months' imprisonment,
OL,20,Fsuspended for 12 months. Both men, who
OL,21,Fhad pleaded guilty to affray, were also
OL,22,Fordered to pay #1,500 costs.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
